# sent_id = 13_Rikicin_tekun_Pasha_8
# text_en = The spokesman said that Muslim leaders in Nigeria wanted to express their lack of support to the occupation that Irak did in Kuweit and then, their lack of support to the attack that the alliance countries did on Irak, which they hastened to do without allowing the sanctions that were inflicted on Irak to take effect.
